---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Stub from '../components/Stub.astro';
import Prerelease from '../components/Prerelease.astro';
import { machines, downloadLinks, platforms } from '../data/machines';
---
<Base title="Download · Lemus" description="Download Lemus plugins for macOS and Windows. Each machine is a separate, free plugin." current="download">
<Stub heading="Download">
<p>Lemus plugins are free. Each machine is a separate plugin.</p>
<ul class="machines">
{machines.map((m) => {
  const links = downloadLinks(m);
  return (
<li>
<div class="head">
<a href={`/${m.slug}`} class="slug">{m.slug}</a>
<span class="dim">{m.emulates} ({m.year})</span>
</div>
{m.release ? (
<>
<div class="buttons">
<a href={links.mac} class="btn">macOS</a>
<a href={links.windows} class="btn">Windows</a>
</div>
<div class="meta">
<span>Version {m.release.version}{m.release.stage && ` ${m.release.stage}`}</span>
{platforms.map(([os, formats]) => <span>{os}: {formats}</span>)}
</div>
<Prerelease release={m.release} />
</>
) : (
<p class="partial">Not available for download yet. The first release is being prepared.</p>
)}
</li>
  );
})}
</ul>
<div class="install">
<h2 id="installing" class="h2">Installing</h2>
<div>
<h3 class="h3">macOS</h3>
<p>The installer puts the AU and VST3 in /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins and the standalone app in /Applications. It isn't signed or notarised yet, so macOS refuses it the first time: allow it with System Settings › Privacy &amp; Security › Open Anyway.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="h3">Windows</h3>
<p>Copy the .vst3 folder to your VST3 folder (C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3 by default, or any folder your DAW scans) and rescan plugins in your DAW. The .exe is the standalone app. Nothing is signed yet: keep the download if the browser warns, and choose More info › Run anyway if SmartScreen stops the app.</p>
</div>
<p>ROM images aren't included: see <a href="/support#rom">Support</a>.</p>
</div>
</Stub>
</Base>

<style>
.machines { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 46em; }
.machines li { border: 2px solid var(--ink); padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 16px; }
.slug { font: 700 22px var(--mono); color: var(--ink); }
.dim { font-size: 15px; }
.buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
.meta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); }
.machines p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
.install { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; max-width: 46em; margin-top: 24px; scroll-margin-top: 16px; }
.install > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.install .h3 { font-size: 21px; }
.install p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink2); font-size: 16px; }
</style>
